        "status": "draft",
        "content_writing": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>The table and charts below give information on the police budget for 2017 and 2018 in one area of Britain. The table shows where the money came from and the charts show how it was distributed. S</strong></span><strong style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">ummarize the information and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></p>",
        "order": 1,
        "description": "<p><strong>The table and charts below give information on the police budget for 2017 and 2018 in one area of Britain. The table shows where the money came from and the charts show how it was distributed. Summarize the information and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></p>",
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Police budget in Britain 2017-2018</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li>Đề b&agrave;i<em> </em>Police budget in Britain 2017-2018 cho 2 charts, y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về:\n<ul>\n<li><strong style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';\">Pie Chart:</strong><span style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';\">&nbsp;Những phần chi ti&ecirc;u được ph&acirc;n bổ bởi ng&acirc;n s&aacute;ch cảnh s&aacute;t (tổng cộng l&agrave; 3 phần)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';\"><strong>Table: </strong>Tổng số nguồn t&agrave;i trợ cho ng&acirc;n s&aacute;ch cảnh s&aacute;t (tổng cộng l&agrave; 3 nguồn)</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RBO3d7IPTo4GeYxDKBxlGIgGgNc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><u><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu tương đối v&agrave; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></u></span> v&agrave; <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><u><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuyet-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu tuyệt đối v&agrave; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></u></span><u><strong> </strong></u>trước khi viết b&agrave;i. V&igrave; đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SR9ZdYWR1o7uhYxz4tklkj5Egmz\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F1b5dV8BRoTcMzxDcCclC1TmgQb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Police budget in Britain 2017-2018 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: Kinh ph&iacute; cho Police ở một khu vực của Britain v&agrave;o 2017-2018: Nguồn t&agrave;i trợ (&pound;), Nguồn chi ti&ecirc;u (%) v&agrave; những thay đổi trong cả funding v&agrave; spending pattern suốt 1 năm</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NYwkd1jG3ojREPxVYXKlUhzvgze\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QLRpdX9QJoixDbxDY0Hl2H72gfc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng Mixed Charts, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XTIOd4swpotmZCx49HOlafYCgeg\" data-list=\"bullet\">Ng&acirc;n s&aacute;ch cảnh s&aacute;t đ&atilde; tăng trưởng ở tất cả c&aacute;c nguồn t&agrave;i trợ giữa hai năm.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XTIOd4swpotmZCx49HOlafYCgeg\" data-list=\"bullet\">Về mặt chi ti&ecirc;u, c&oacute; sự thay đổi đ&aacute;ng ch&uacute; &yacute; hướng tới việc tăng chi ti&ecirc;u cho c&ocirc;ng nghệ, trong khi tỷ lệ ph&acirc;n bổ cho c&aacute;c t&ograve;a nh&agrave; v&agrave; giao th&ocirc;ng giảm tương ứng.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZrvgdhtrQovJnNxqKVSl5FLhgxe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch chia mỗi BODY tương ứng với 1 chart:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IVPxdrYypohRjbxFqFTlbGXjgJf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SKFjdgHCioWHAJxgLNslzYgBgdh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1: </strong><strong>Table - So s&aacute;nh số liệu về tổng số tiền được t&agrave;i trợ bởi c&aacute;c nguồn</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Rzwzd9GqJoFw05xfGCdlOYMXgeg\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqCZd69UzozmzJxdGgRlii2dgvh\" data-list=\"bullet\">Năm 2017, ch&iacute;nh phủ trung ương l&agrave; nh&agrave; đ&oacute;ng g&oacute;p lớn nhất năm 2017 với 175,5 triệu bảng, cao hơn đ&aacute;ng kể so với thuế địa phương cung cấp 91,2 triệu bảng, trong khi c&aacute;c nguồn kh&aacute;c đ&oacute;ng g&oacute;p 38 triệu bảng.&nbsp;</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqCZd69UzozmzJxdGgRlii2dgvh\" data-list=\"bullet\">Đến năm 2018, thuế địa phương cho thấy mức tăng đ&aacute;ng kể nhất, tăng 11,1 triệu bảng l&ecirc;n 102,3 triệu bảng. T&agrave;i trợ từ ch&iacute;nh phủ trung ương cũng tăng, tuy nhi&ecirc;n <strong>khi&ecirc;m tốn hơn</strong> <em>(more modestly)</em>, l&ecirc;n 177,8 triệu bảng, trong khi c&aacute;c nguồn kh&aacute;c tăng nhẹ l&ecirc;n 38,5 triệu bảng.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BNxmdbwh6ooxrxxJhiIl92Cagsb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WgYudlj0yogUWVxEXShlKslbgrg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong>:<strong> Pie chart - So s&aacute;nh phần trăm của những mục được chi ti&ecirc;u&nbsp;</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mr5jdwKpIof970xQ11tlunKNgvc\">Theo<strong> Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup>, </strong>ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QfqedzaFioIDHHxqQ2Ul2dLTgBh\" data-list=\"bullet\">Phần trăm chi ti&ecirc;u của c&aacute;c t&ograve;a nh&agrave; v&agrave; giao th&ocirc;ng <strong>chiếm ưu thế trong ng&acirc;n s&aacute;ch</strong> <em>(dominated the budget)</em> năm 2017, chiếm ba phần tư chi ti&ecirc;u ở mức 75%, trong khi chi ph&iacute; lương cho c&aacute;n bộ v&agrave; nh&acirc;n vi&ecirc;n chiếm 17%, v&agrave; c&ocirc;ng nghệ chỉ chiếm 8%.&nbsp;</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QfqedzaFioIDHHxqQ2Ul2dLTgBh\" data-list=\"bullet\">Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, chi ti&ecirc;u cho c&ocirc;ng nghệ <strong>gần như tăng gấp đ&ocirc;i</strong> <em>(doubled its share)</em> l&ecirc;n 14% năm 2018, trong khi c&aacute;c t&ograve;a nh&agrave; v&agrave; giao th&ocirc;ng giảm xuống 69%. Trong khi đ&oacute;, chi ph&iacute; lương vẫn ổn định ở mức 17% trong suốt thời kỳ n&agrave;y.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bc2gdrij0o2chcxcadllSjTsgke\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XdYcdsZ6Uo6tuXxGPs3lNnJUgHh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HE29dhmJjod0qix8V1qlgw9gggc\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong>&nbsp;Gợi &yacute; paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TN6Fd9B0PohTNjxAWltlSG3sgUg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MgpOdgFa5orVtdxiKOPliFF8gih\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RYRddABRToQrqNxG0fSl7OrOg5c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YdvRdtEEMoe1nqxSg4NlhL6GgQf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WIUnd6WAUoXWJSx4xA3lyHevgsb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GzVudZspKo0jPLxbMunl1LTAgjc\">Khi muốn diễn đạt&nbsp;<strong>\"tiền quỹ đến từ nguồn n&agrave;o\"</strong>, thay v&igrave; lặp lại&nbsp;<strong>\"&nbsp;where the money came from\"</strong>